# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Customer data must never reach this repository.
#
# This repo is PUBLIC (GitHub Pages is enabled on it). Everything labelkb
# derives from the artwork corpus — brand names, compositions, manufacturer
# addresses, manufacturing licence numbers — belongs to Dada Print Art's
# customers and stays on the machine that generated it.
#
# Tool code and rule packs are committed. Extracted data is not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
kb/
renders/
tools/labelkb/kb/
tools/labelkb/renders/
*.jobs.jsonl

# Artwork and press-source files, wherever they land
*.pdf
*.cdr
*.ai
*.indd
*.psd
*.ard
*.ARD
*.info

# ...but the checked-in test fixtures are safe and required by the suite.
!tools/labelkb/tests/fixtures/*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
dist/
build/
